preproc-imdb
Copyright 2019-2026 Nat Lee

This product is an unofficial, reproducible re-implementation of the IMDb experiments in
"On the Role of Text Preprocessing in Neural Network Architectures: An Evaluation Study on
Text Categorization and Sentiment Analysis" by Jose Camacho-Collados and Mohammad Taher
Pilehvar (BlackboxNLP 2018, https://doi.org/10.18653/v1/W18-5406).
https://github.com/NatLee/on-the-role-of-text-preprocessing-in-neural-network-architectures-for-imdb

If you use this software or results produced with it, please cite both this software and
the original paper. CITATION.cff and the "How to cite" section of README.md have the
entries, including BibTeX.

The study, its preprocessed datasets and its word embeddings are by Jose Camacho-Collados
and Mohammad Taher Pilehvar (https://github.com/pedrada88/preproc-textclassification).
The first version of this repository (2019) was adapted from their sensecnn code
(https://github.com/pilehvar/sensecnn, Pilehvar et al., ACL 2017).
